From: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:49:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: flowtable: advertise populated VLAN match keys

The flowtable fills VLAN matches without publishing their used_keys
bits. Drivers using flow_rule_match_key() cannot see the VID, and PPE
rejects tagged ingress rules containing a VLAN pop action.

Publish the VLAN and CVLAN keys at each location where they are filled.
This follows the fix proposed by Julius Bairaktaris on netfilter-devel.

Fixes: 3e1b0c168f6c ("netfilter: flowtable: add vlan match offload support")
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/netfilter-devel/20260913104251.648421-3-julius@bairaktaris.de/
Signed-off-by: JiaY-shi <shi05275@163.com>
---
--- a/net/netfilter/nf_flow_table_offload.c
+++ b/net/netfilter/nf_flow_table_offload.c
@@ -124,6 +124,7 @@ static int nf_flow_rule_match(struct nf_flow_match *match,
 		nf_flow_rule_vlan_match(&key->vlan, &mask->vlan,
 					tuple->encap[0].id,
 					tuple->encap[0].proto);
+		match->dissector.used_keys |= BIT_ULL(FLOW_DISSECTOR_KEY_VLAN);
 		vlan_encap = true;
 	}
 
@@ -135,12 +136,16 @@ static int nf_flow_rule_match(struct nf_flow_match *match,
 			nf_flow_rule_vlan_match(&key->cvlan, &mask->cvlan,
 						tuple->encap[1].id,
 						tuple->encap[1].proto);
+			match->dissector.used_keys |=
+				BIT_ULL(FLOW_DISSECTOR_KEY_CVLAN);
 		} else {
 			NF_FLOW_DISSECTOR(match, FLOW_DISSECTOR_KEY_VLAN,
 					  vlan);
 			nf_flow_rule_vlan_match(&key->vlan, &mask->vlan,
 						tuple->encap[1].id,
 						tuple->encap[1].proto);
+			match->dissector.used_keys |=
+				BIT_ULL(FLOW_DISSECTOR_KEY_VLAN);
 		}
 	}
 
